* LTC4281 12 V hot-swap controller
* Uses the genuine Analog Devices LTC4281 LTspice macromodel.
* Expected model pin order:
* INTVCC VDD SENSE+ SENSE- GATE SOURCE UV OV TIMER FB GND
.lib LTC4281.sub

VINPUT IN 0 PULSE(0 12 1m 100u 100u 1 2)

* Input bypassing
CIN IN 0 10u
CINHF IN 0 100n

* 5 mOhm current-sense resistor
RSENSE IN SNS 5m

* LTC4281 controller
XU1 INTVCC IN IN SNS GATE_CTL OUT UV OV TIMER FB 0 LTC4281
CINTVCC INTVCC 0 1u

* External hot-swap N-channel MOSFET and gate damping
RGATE GATE_CTL GATE 10
MHS SNS GATE OUT OUT HSFET
.model HSFET NMOS(Level=1 VTO=3 KP=50m LAMBDA=2m RD=5m RS=5m)
CGS GATE OUT 2n
CGD GATE SNS 300p
RGS GATE OUT 100k

* Undervoltage threshold: approximately 9.5 V
RUVTOP IN UV 681k
RUVBOT UV 0 100k
CUV UV 0 10n

* Overvoltage threshold: approximately 14.5 V
ROVTOP IN OV 1.00Meg
ROVBOT OV 0 100k
COV OV 0 10n

* Fault timing capacitor
CTIMER TIMER 0 47n

* Output feedback divider, approximately 10.5 V power-good threshold
RFBTOP OUT FB 750k
RFBBOT FB 0 100k
CFB FB 0 10n

* Output capacitance and 1 A nominal resistive load
COUT OUT 0 470u
RLOAD OUT 0 12

.tran 0 100m 0 10u
.meas tran VOUT_DC AVG V(OUT) FROM 80m TO 100m
.meas tran ILOAD_DC AVG I(RLOAD) FROM 80m TO 100m

.end
